CORE
main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* anonymous struct: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* anonymous union: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A designator naming a member of an anonymous struct or union, a GNU
extension in C++, was rejected ("failed to find struct component"): the C++
front end names the unnamed class, which the designator lookup took as a
named one.
